      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vining%2C_Kansas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Vining straddles Clay and Washington counties, with Washington County north of Parallel Street and Clay County south of it.",
